This repository is a scoped demonstration submitted to the Arm Create:
AI Optimization Challenge 2026 (Track 3: Mobile AI). It builds on top of
ExecuTorch (PyTorch Edge), which is separately licensed — see
https://github.com/pytorch/executorch for its license terms.

`scripts/convert_qwen_checkpoint.py` includes a small helper function
(`get_mapped_key`) and a Qwen2.5 weight-key mapping adapted from
pytorch/torchtune (torchtune/models/convert_weights.py) and
pytorch/executorch (examples/models/qwen2_5/convert_weights.py), both
